OL,3,GNEWSAPM pledges breast cancer care
OL,4,Ainquiry and police boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said the
OL,7,Fhundreds of victims of breast cancer
OL,8,Fcare failings at County Durham and
OL,9,FDarlington NHS Trust will get "all of
OL,10,Fthe answers they need".
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC Politics North, Andy
OL,13,FBurnham said he would ensure the
OL,14,F"fullest possible inquiry", but would
OL,15,Fnot guarantee what form it would take.
OL,16,FHis pledge comes after the trust agreed
OL,17,Fto review up to a further 4,500 cases
OL,18,Fincluding delayed diagnoses and
OL,19,Funnecessary surgeries.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
