OL,3,GNEWSAPM pledges breast cancer care
OL,4,Ainquiry and police boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham also promised to visit Teesside
OL,7,Fand address the "unfair shortage" of
OL,8,FCleveland Police officers.
OL,10,FMeanwhile, he said he wanted to address
OL,11,Ftransport issues across north-east
OL,12,FEngland, including the long-running row
OL,13,Fover dualling the A1.
